{"id":"gesicht","lemma":"Gesicht","pos":"noun","rank":381,"glosses":["face","a facial expression, a look","that which is outward or in front"],"ipa":"/ɡəˈzɪçt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/43/De-Gesicht.ogg/De-Gesicht.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Gesichtes","plural":"Gesichter"},"examples":[{"text":"Hast du ihr Gesicht gesehen?","en":"Did you see her face?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},null,{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"}]},{"text":"Ich sah das Gesicht meiner Mutter.","en":"I saw my mother's face.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/757911","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"},{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"my","l":"mein"},{"g":"mother"}]},{"text":"Sie haben unsere Gesichter gesehen.","en":"They've seen our faces.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"our","l":"unser"},null,{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"}]},{"text":"Die Sonne scheint mir ins Gesicht.","en":"The sun is shining in my face.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/695608","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"a sun"},{"g":"to shine","l":"scheinen"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"into the"},null]},{"text":"Was denkst du über dein Gesicht?","en":"What do you think of your own face?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to think","l":"denken"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"[with accusative or…"},{"g":"your"},null]}]}